at the school board.

1093
00:59:45.899 --> 00:59:48.182
Apparently you're taking
your students on a trip?

1094
00:59:48.251 --> 00:59:49.967
Yes. but it's over the weekend.

1095
00:59:50.037 --> 00:59:51.780
so it won't affect
any test schedules.

1096
00:59:51.804 --> 00:59:53.538
I know how busy you are.

1097
00:59:53.607 --> 00:59:58.093
and since
I'm paying for it myself.
I didn't want to bother you.

1098
00:59:58.162 --> 00:59:59.894
<i>(OFFICER</i>
BY THE PHARCYDE PLAYING)

1099
01:00:07.104 --> 01:00:08.970
<i>♪ I got a letter
from the DMV</i>

1100
01:00:09.039 --> 01:00:10.817
<i>♪ The other day
I opened and read it</i>

1101
01:00:10.841 --> 01:00:12.741
<i>♪ It said they were suckers ♪</i>

1102
01:00:19.299 --> 01:00:20.465
I'll be right back.

1103
01:00:20.534 --> 01:00:23.652
Oh. no. No. no. no. Erin?

1104
01:00:23.720 --> 01:00:25.203
Get back in the car.

1105
01:00:25.272 --> 01:00:26.655
Dad. he lives right here.

1106
01:00:26.723 --> 01:00:27.838
I'll get him.

1107
01:00:27.907 --> 01:00:30.208
Get back in the car
