1247
01:10:13.626 --> 01:10:15.410
Okay. guys. gals. listen up!

1248
01:10:15.478 --> 01:10:17.356
This is what I want you to do.

1249
01:10:17.380 --> 01:10:19.341
I want each of you
to step forward

1250
01:10:19.365 --> 01:10:21.515
and take one
of these Borders bags.

1251
01:10:21.584 --> 01:10:24.518
which contain
the four books we're
gonna read this semester.

1252
01:10:24.587 --> 01:10:26.465
(ALL CHEERING)
BOY: All right!

1253
01:10:26.489 --> 01:10:28.873
They're very special books.

1254
01:10:28.942 --> 01:10:33.360
and they each remind me.
in some way. of each of you.

1255
01:10:33.429 --> 01:10:35.496
ALL: Aw.

1256
01:10:37.316 --> 01:10:41.135
But. before you take the books.

1257
01:10:41.204 --> 01:10:45.023
I want you to take
one of these glasses
of sparkling cider.

1258
01:10:45.091 --> 01:10:48.926
and I want each of you
to make a toast.

1259
01:10:50.196 --> 01:10:54.081
We're each gonna make
a toast for change.

1260
01:10:54.150 --> 01:10:59.203
And what that means is.
from this moment on

1261
01:10:59.272 --> 01:11:04.442
every voice that told you
"You can't" is silenced.

1262
01:11:05.812 --> 01:11:10.281
Every reason that tells you
things will never change.

1263
01:11:10.350 --> 01:11:12.533
disappears.

1264
01:11:12.602 --> 01:11:15.670
And the person you were
before this moment.

1265
01:11:15.738 --> 01:11:17.805
that person's turn is over.

1266
01:11:17.874 --> 01:11:19.724
Now it's your turn.

1267
01:11:20.476 --> 01:11:22.810
Okay?

1268
01:11:22.879 --> 01:11:26.414
Okay. you ready to get
this party going on?

1269
01:11:26.482 --> 01:11:28.332
(ALL GROANING)

1270
01:11:29.802 --> 01:11:31.664
What?
Stop doing that. man.

1271
01:11:31.688 --> 01:11:33.287
What's the dealio?

1272
01:11:41.347 --> 01:11:44.432
Man. I've had boyfriends
since I was. like. 11.
you know.

1273
01:11:45.067 --> 01:11:46.450
I believe you.

1274
01:11:46.519 --> 01:11:48.169
Shut up.

1275
01:11:48.237 --> 01:11:51.439
Okay. well.
I was always the person

1276
01:11:51.507 --> 01:11:54.976
that was gonna get pregnant
before I turned 16
and drop out.

1277
01:11:55.845 --> 01:11:57.227
Like my mom.

1278
01:12:01.184 --> 01:12:02.766
Ain't gonna happen.

1279
01:12:02.835 --> 01:12:05.770
Nobody ever listens
to a teenager.

1280
01:12:05.855 --> 01:12:09.524
Everybody thinks
you should be happy
just because you're young.

1281
01:12:09.592 --> 01:12:13.311
They don't see the wars
that we fight
every single day.

1282
01:12:13.379 --> 01:12:15.612
And one day. my war will end.

1283
01:12:15.681 --> 01:12:17.481
And I will not die.

1284
01:12:18.884 --> 01:12:22.386
And I will not tolerate
abuse from anyone.

1285
01:12:25.875 --> 01:12:27.375
I am strong.

1286
01:12:27.443 --> 01:12:30.594
My moms kicked me out
when I got jumped into
the gang life.

1287
01:12:31.697 --> 01:12:34.031
But I'd like her
to see me graduate.

1288
01:12:35.601 --> 01:12:37.434
I'd like to be 18.

1289
01:12:41.724 --> 01:12:43.191
Ms. G?

1290
01:12:43.259 --> 01:12:45.292
Can I read something
from my diary?

1291
01:12:45.361 --> 01:12:46.844
That'd be great.

1292
01:12:50.783 --> 01:12:52.633
Who is he?

1293
01:12:52.701 --> 01:12:55.036
Man. he's been with us
from freshman year. fool.

1294
01:12:55.104 --> 01:12:56.537
What's his name?

1295
01:12:56.605 --> 01:12:59.206
I don't know.

1296
01:12:59.275 --> 01:13:04.445
"This summer
was the worst summer
in my short 14 years of life.

1297
01:13:04.514 --> 01:13:07.081
"It all started
with a phone call.

1298
01:13:07.149 --> 01:13:09.617
"My mother was crying
and begging.

1299
01:13:09.686 --> 01:13:14.321
"asking for more time
as if she were gasping
for her last breath of air.

1300
01:13:15.641 --> 01:13:18.759
"She held me as tight
as she could and cried.

1301
01:13:18.812 --> 01:13:22.663
"Her tears hit my shirt
like bullets and told me

1302
01:13:22.732 --> 01:13:24.599
"we were being evicted.

1303
01:13:24.667 --> 01:13:26.617
"She kept apologizing to me.

1304
01:13:26.686 --> 01:13:28.636
"I thought. 'I have no home.

1305
01:13:28.705 --> 01:13:32.523
"'I should have asked
for something less expensive
at Christmas.'

1306
01:13:32.609 --> 01:13:34.569
"On the morning of the eviction.

1307
01:13:34.593 --> 01:13:36.626
"a hard knock
on the door woke me up.

1308
01:13:36.695 --> 01:13:40.047
"The sheriff was there
to do his job.

1309
01:13:40.116 --> 01:13:43.684
"I looked up at the sky.
waiting for something
to happen.

1310
01:13:45.488 --> 01:13:49.539
"My mother
has no family to lean on.
no money coming in.

1311
01:13:49.608 --> 01:13:53.861
"Why bother coming to school
or getting good grades
if I'm homeless?

1312
01:13:53.930 --> 01:13:56.030
"The bus stops
in front of the school.

1313
01:13:56.099 --> 01:13:57.832
"I feel like throwing up.

1314
01:13:57.901 --> 01:14:00.167
"I'm wearing clothes
from last year.

1315
01:14:00.219 --> 01:14:03.303
"some old shoes
and no new haircut.

1316
01:14:03.372 --> 01:14:05.723
"I kept thinking
I'd get laughed at.

1317
01:14:05.792 --> 01:14:08.292
"Instead. I'm greeted
by a couple of friends

1318
01:14:08.361 --> 01:14:10.727
"who were in
my English class last year.

1319
01:14:10.796 --> 01:14:13.748
"And it hits me.
Mrs. Gruwell.

1320
01:14:13.817 --> 01:14:16.100
"my crazy English teacher
from last year.

1321
01:14:16.169 --> 01:14:19.854
"is the only person
that made me think of hope.

1322
01:14:19.923 --> 01:14:23.407
"Talking with friends
about last year's English
and our trips.

1323
01:14:23.476 --> 01:14:26.060
"I began to feel better.

1324
01:14:26.129 --> 01:14:28.390
"I receive my schedule
and the first teacher

1325
01:14:28.414 --> 01:14:31.365
is Mrs. Gruwell in Room 203.

1326
01:14:31.434 --> 01:14:34.468
"I walk into the room
and feel as though

1327
01:14:34.537 --> 01:14:38.239
"all the problems in life
are not so important anymore.

1328
01:14:38.808 --> 01:14:40.308
"I am home."

1329
01:14:42.277 --> 01:14:43.777
Yes. you are.

1330
01:15:04.367 --> 01:15:06.217
But you're an honors student.

1331
01:15:06.286 --> 01:15:07.997
If you transfer
to Ms. Gruwell's class.

1332
01:15:08.021 --> 01:15:10.137
think how that will reflect
on your records.

1333
01:15:10.205 --> 01:15:11.555
It doesn't matter to me.

1334
01:15:11.623 --> 01:15:13.624
My grades
will still be the same.

1335
01:15:13.693 --> 01:15:15.593
Look. Ms. Campbell.

1336
01:15:15.661 --> 01:15:19.529
When I first transferred
to the school.
I had a 4.0 average.

1337
01:15:19.599 --> 01:15:21.543
But when I applied
for advanced placement

1338
01:15:21.567 --> 01:15:23.317
at English and Math.

1339
01:15:23.386 --> 01:15:26.198
I was told it would be better
for me to be in a class
with my own kind.

1340
01:15:26.222 --> 01:15:29.173
Now. when I did get in.
my teacher said.

1341
01:15:29.242 --> 01:15:32.927
"Victoria.
it's not every day one finds
an African-American student

1342
01:15:32.995 --> 01:15:36.880
"in A.P. and honors courses."
As if I didn't notice.

1343
01:15:36.949 --> 01:15:39.399
And when I asked
another honors teacher

1344
01:15:39.468 --> 01:15:42.347
why we don't read
more black literature.
she said.

1345
01:15:42.371 --> 01:15:44.532
"We don't read
black literature
because of all the sex.

1346
01:15:44.556 --> 01:15:46.876
"drugs. cussing
and fornication!"

1347
01:15:48.760 --> 01:15:52.896
I thought a simple
"It's inappropriate"
would have sufficed.

1348
01:15:57.620 --> 01:15:59.753
Erin can't do that!

1349
01:15:59.822 --> 01:16:02.623
Distinguished
Honor Students are mine.

1350
01:16:02.692 --> 01:16:05.358
She's not allowed
to teach them.
She's only been here a year.

1351
01:16:05.427 --> 01:16:07.061
The student requested it.

1352
01:16:07.129 --> 01:16:09.747
And Gruwell has got Cohn
in her back pocket.

1353
01:16:10.999 --> 01:16:12.700
What gets me is they're violent.

1354
01:16:12.768 --> 01:16:15.836
they break laws.
they destroy school property

1355
01:16:15.904 --> 01:16:19.674
and in the end we
make them special.
We reward them like...

1356
01:16:21.160 --> 01:16:24.045
I just don't see
what that teaches them.

1357
01:16:24.113 --> 01:16:25.479
<i>(T.V. BLARING)</i>
ERIN: Hi!

1358
01:16:25.547 --> 01:16:27.009
(MUTES T.V.)
Sorry I'm late.

1359
01:16:27.033 --> 01:16:29.166
Did you eat? I'm ordering in.
Are you hungry?

1360
01:16:29.252 --> 01:16:31.179
What question do you
want me to answer first?

1361
01:16:31.203 --> 01:16:32.670
Did I eat or am I hungry?

1362
01:16:32.739 --> 01:16:34.304
I ate. I'm not hungry.

1363
01:16:34.373 --> 01:16:37.524
Something really cool
happened today.
I got an honors student.

1364
01:16:37.593 --> 01:16:39.526
Congratulations.
Isn't that great?

1365
01:16:39.595 --> 01:16:41.562
She actually requested my class.

1366
01:16:41.630 --> 01:16:43.897
Can you teach an honors student?

1367
01:16:43.966 --> 01:16:45.433
What do you mean?

1368
01:16:45.501 --> 01:16:47.963
Well. I mean.
you're used to teaching
your kind of kids.

1369
01:16:47.987 --> 01:16:50.067
Can you teach
somebody who's smart?

1370
01:16:51.090 --> 01:16:54.308
Of course I can.
Yeah. but it's not
like you have. right?

1371
01:16:54.376 --> 01:16:58.012
I mean.
you don't really teach
what everybody else teaches.

1372
01:16:59.182 --> 01:17:00.981
My kids' grades are up to B's.

1373
01:17:01.050 --> 01:17:03.410
Yeah. but the point is.
that's according to you.

1374
01:17:03.452 --> 01:17:04.930
It's not like
they're really learning

1375
01:17:04.954 --> 01:17:06.465
what normal kids have to learn.

1376
01:17:06.489 --> 01:17:08.372
Normal kids? Yes. they are.

1377
01:17:08.441 --> 01:17:10.019
They're reading
<i>The Diary of Anne Frank.</i>

1378
01:17:10.043 --> 01:17:12.460
They're learning vocabulary.
grammar. writing. poetry.

1379
01:17:12.528 --> 01:17:14.945
All right. Okay.
I apologize. Sorry.

1380
01:17:15.748 --> 01:17:17.347
Congratulations.

1381
01:17:25.374 --> 01:17:26.507
What is wrong with you?

1382
01:17:26.575 --> 01:17:28.803
You know. at Deb's party.
I heard you telling people

1383
01:17:28.827 --> 01:17:31.140
that I was an architect
and that my job
was temporary.

1384
01:17:31.164 --> 01:17:34.231
I want you to stop that.
all right? I like my job.

1385
01:17:34.299 --> 01:17:36.216
Fine.

